  REFUSED -- NO NEW AXIS. Only 0 teachable axes clear liveness,
  independence and 2 levels, and aimaxes already had 2 (F1, F2). The
  accumulation prize argued in §41 does NOT exist at the larynx: the
  item count cannot be grown by adding axes, because there are none to
  add. §41's clause-2 refusal, and the line stops at run 1 of 3.
